es against the chess AI on different difficulty levels in a lovingly designed environment. \n\nDay-One Features:\n- designed from the ground up for mobile VR headsets\n- mixed reality / passthrough for chess games in your real world (experimental)\n- handtracking: grab and place chess pieces on the board with your real hands  (experimental)\n- choice of different difficulties from beginner friendly to expert.\n- lovingly designed environment with classical music and a fireplace\n\nRoadmap 2024:\n- new and different environments\n- new chessboard and chesspieces designs\n- time game\n- online mode / lichess or other chess online platform\n- request a feature you would like to see in the game over our contact form at https://ionic-optimists.de", "short_description": "Play exciting and realistic chess games against the chess AI on different elo levels in a lovingly designed environment. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ionic-optimists.de/index.php?page=privacy-apps", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ionic Optimists", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ionic-optimists.de/index.php?page=home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7034804719946660"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25